Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Simon Roessig work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 7, "end": 196, "text": "Sophia Patel made her way through the bustling corridors of Leicester General Hospital, she couldn't help but notice the faint scent of freshly brewed coffee wafting from the research wing."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 197, "end": 271, "text": "It was a familiar aroma, one that always seemed to precede a breakthrough."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 272, "end": 413, "text": "She quickened her pace, her eyes scanning the rows of offices until she spotted the nameplate she was looking for: Simon Roessig, Researcher."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 414, "end": 552, "text": "Sophia had heard whispers about Simon's groundbreaking work in the field of cardiovascular medicine, and she was determined to learn more."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 553, "end": 627, "text": "She knocked softly on the door, and a warm, baritone voice invited her in."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 628, "end": 756, "text": "As she entered, Simon looked up from his cluttered desk, his eyes crinkling at the corners behind a pair of wire-rimmed glasses."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 757, "end": 761, "text": "\"Dr."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 762, "end": 805, "text": "Patel, what brings you to my humble abode?\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 806, "end": 884, "text": "he asked, his German accent a gentle reminder of his international background."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 885, "end": 984, "text": "Sophia took a seat, her eyes roving over the shelves lined with dusty tomes and dog-eared journals."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 985, "end": 1048, "text": "\"I've heard rumors of your work on cardiac regeneration, Simon."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1049, "end": 1088, "text": "I'd love to discuss the possibilities.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1089, "end": 1159, "text": "Simon leaned back in his chair, a hint of a smile playing on his lips."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1160, "end": 1169, "text": "\"Ah, yes."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1170, "end": 1317, "text": "The University Hospitals of Leicester NHS Trust has been kind enough to provide me with the resources to explore some...unconventional approaches.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1318, "end": 1463, "text": "As they delved into the intricacies of Simon's research, Sophia found herself drawn into a world of cutting-edge science and innovative thinking."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1464, "end": 1614, "text": "It was clear that Simon's work was not only pushing the boundaries of medical knowledge but also benefiting from the Trust's commitment to excellence."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1615, "end": 1818, "text": "As their meeting drew to a close, Sophia glanced around the office, taking in the faded certificates on the walls, the worn leather armchair in the corner, and the steaming cup of coffee on Simon's desk."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1819, "end": 1993, "text": "It was a space that seemed to embody the very essence of the University Hospitals of Leicester NHS Trust: a blend of tradition, innovation, and a passion for improving lives."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1994, "end": 2088, "text": "\"I think we could make some real progress together, Simon,\" Sophia said, rising from her seat."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2089, "end": 2127, "text": "Simon's eyes sparkled with enthusiasm."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2128, "end": 2155, "text": "\"I couldn't agree more, Dr."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2156, "end": 2162, "text": "Patel."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2163, "end": 2284, "text": "The Trust has given me the freedom to explore, and I believe our collaboration could lead to something truly remarkable.\""}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2285, "end": 2363, "text": "As Sophia left the office, she felt a sense of excitement building within her."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "Title: The Academic Odyssey of Simon Roessig: Unraveling the Ties to the University of Cologne"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 96, "end": 293, "text": "In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge and innovation reigns supreme, researchers like Simon Roessig have dedicated their lives to unraveling the mysteries of their chosen fields."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 294, "end": 454, "text": "As we delve into the narrative of Simon's illustrious career, a fascinating thread emerges, weaving together the intricate tapestry of his professional journey."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 455, "end": 582, "text": "At the heart of this narrative lies a profound connection – one that binds Simon Roessig to the esteemed University of Cologne."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 583, "end": 773, "text": "Our story begins with Simon's early academic pursuits, where his insatiable curiosity and passion for discovery set him on a path that would eventually lead him to the University of Cologne."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 774, "end": 921, "text": "